  Slug: root-epithet
  DisplayName: Root Epithet
  IconPath: icons/commodities/treasure/token-engraved-green-glowing.webp
  Description: "As your story unfolds, your personality and deeds begin to shape
    the potential of your divine spark. You come to bear an epithet\u2014a word or
    phrase that seems to always stick in the mind of those describing you. (You can
    find examples of acquiring epithets in the Earning your Name sidebar on page
    35.) Your epithets grant you additional abilities, especially when your divine
    spark is brought to the surface. You first gain a root epithet to describe an
    aspect of your personality. This grants you a skill, as well as a special effect
    that occurs when you Spark Transcendence. If you are already trained in the granted
    skill, you become trained in a different skill of your choice, as normal. An
    effect that occurs after you Spark Transcendence happens immediately after your
    transcendence action is completely resolved."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
